  "prefLabel": "Ncr 523.01 Registration Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 523.01 Registration Required. Each primary wood processing mill or wood concentration yard shall be registered prior to initial startup and renewed annually thereafter. A primary wood processing mill or concentration yard owner or operator shall apply for registration by completing and submitting Form 520, as described in Ncr 523.02.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5203.01), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
